      "text": "IN THE HIGH COURT OF EXAMPLE STATE\nW.P. No. 1234 of 2026\nCORAM: HON'BLE JUSTICE A. RAO\nDate of Judgment: 20 August 2026\nR. Menon ... Petitioner\nversus\nState of Example State and Others ... Respondents\nJUDGMENT\n1. Facts\n1.1 The petitioner was appointed as a clerk in 2019 and his services were terminated on 5 January 2026 without notice.\n2. Arguments\n2.1 Counsel for the petitioner contended that no notice was given before termination.\n2.2 Counsel for the respondents submitted that the appointment was temporary.",
