      "text": "3. Issue\n3.1 Whether the termination of the petitioner without notice was valid.\n4. Findings\n4.1 The appointment order required one month's notice before termination, which was not given.\n5. Order\n5.1 The writ petition is allowed. The respondents are directed to reinstate the petitioner within four (4) weeks.",
